---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="One-Hour Game Experiment | Lab | Wretzelectronics">
  <article class="lab-article">
    <header class="article-header">
      <div class="tag-row">
        <span class="tag-badge">Rapid Prototyping</span>
        <span class="tag-badge">JavaScript</span>
        <span class="tag-badge">HTML5 Canvas</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="article-title">One-Hour Game Experiment</h1>
      <p class="article-tagline">Neon Cyber-Slime Breakout built racing against a 60-minute clock.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="hero-image-wrapper">
      <img src="/images/labs/lab-game.png" alt="One-hour game main menu" class="hero-img" />
    </div>

    <!-- Play & Source Action Section -->
    <div class="play-action-card cyber-card">
      <p class="action-text">Test out the 60-minute build live in your browser or explore the code:</p>
      <div class="action-buttons">
        <a
          href="/labs/games/Breakout_NeonCyberSlime/index.html"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="play-button"
        >
          <span>▶ Play Neon Cyber-Slime Breakout</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://github.com/wretzel01/Breakout_NeonCyberSlime"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="cyber-button"
        >
          <svg class="github-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18">
            <path fill="currentColor" d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="button-text">View Source on GitHub</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>The Challenge & Setup</h2>
      <p>
        This lab was a rapid prototyping challenge: build a complete game in one hour using a
        randomly selected type and theme. The wheel landed on a Breakout clone with a “neon
        cyber-slime” aesthetic. With no prior game development experience, I jumped straight into
        coding screens, backgrounds, and a flawed level system while racing the timer.
      </p>

      <h2>The Outcome & Lessons Learned</h2>
      <p>
        The result was chaotic but hilarious: cursed ball physics, a bug that forced every level
        button to load level 1, and a 250-line main orchestrator that overwhelmed the structure.
        Despite the mess, the theme was followed, the game ran, and the experiment taught me a lot
        about rapid iteration, debugging under pressure, and the value of planning—even when the
        timer is ticking.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Gallery Section -->
    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Game Screenshots</h2>
      <div class="gallery-grid">
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <span class="gallery-label">Title Screen</span>
          <img src="/images/labs/lab-game.png" alt="Game menu" class="gallery-img" />
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <span class="gallery-label">Level Selection</span>
          <img src="/images/labs/lab-game-levelselect.png" alt="Game level select" class="gallery-img" />
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <span class="gallery-label">In-Game Action</span>
          <img src="/images/labs/lab-game-level.png" alt="Game level play" class="gallery-img" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lab-article {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .article-header {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .tag-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .article-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .article-tagline {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8);
  }

  .hero-image-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
    background: #000;
  }

  .hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 420px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  /* Play & GitHub Button Card */
  .play-action-card {
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    border-color: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4);
  }

  .action-text {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .action-buttons {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  a.play-button,
  a.play-button:link,
  a.play-button:visited {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--border-neon, #00f0ff);
    color: #0a0c10 !important;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--border-glow, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4));
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  a.play-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.02);
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.6);
    background: #50f4ff;
    color: #0a0c10 !important;
  }

  a.cyber-button,
  a.cyber-button:link,
  a.cyber-button:visited {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-neon, #00f0ff);
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
  }

  a.cyber-button:hover {
    background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
    box-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--border-glow, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.6));
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    color: var(--border-neon, #00f0ff) !important;
  }

  .github-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    fill: currentColor;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .content-section h2:not(:first-child) {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .content-section p {
    color: var(--text-main, #e2e8f0);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* Screenshots Grid */
  .gallery-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .gallery-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .gallery-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--border-neon, #00f0ff);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .gallery-img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    background: #000;
    display: block;
  }
</style>